# Schema files

Each API feature has its own schema file. Do not add a model to a file that describes a different feature.

Backend models live in `backend/app/schemas/`. Frontend wire types live in `frontend/src/schemas/` and `dashboard/src/schemas/`. Match the feature name on both sides.

- Catalog, forms, and regional dex stay in `catalog`.
- The species page stays in `pokemon_detail` / `pokemonDetail`.
- Spawns, learnsets, movesets, obtainability, and acquisition each have their own file.
- Box scanner stays in `scanner`. It does not share a file with Pokédex models.
- Auth, collection, admin, and health/version stay in their own files.

A response and the request that belongs to it live with that feature. Nested types used only by that response stay in the same file.
